<div id="urduTextPath">محرم ۱-۲-۳/کسی بیمار نے خط اپنے مسیحا کو لکھا</div>
<p>kisi beemar ne khat apne masiha ko likha<br />
haal bimariyo'n ka beti ne baba ko likha<br />
jo bhi armaan tha dil me shah-e- waala ko likha<br />
aur salaam apna phupi saniye zehra ko likha</p>

<p>dil me qush thi ke mera qat jo pahonch jayega<br />
hai yaqee'n ab koi lene ke liye aayega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qat me alqaab ye bekas ne kiya tha marqoom<br />
chahne waale pidar mere imam-e- mazloom<br />
raat din roti padi rehti hu ab to maghmoom<br />
aap to bhoolgaye qair ye mera maqsoom</p>

<p>na gilaa tum se hai na koi shikayat baba<br />
haan mubarak ho sakina se mohabbat baba<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qair tum ko na sahi, mujh ko hai tum se ulfat<br />
kisi surat mujhe dikhlaao tum apni surat<br />
jaanti hoon ke sakina pa bahut hai shaffqat<br />
accha aye baba bahan ki mai karoongi qidmat</p>

<p>mujh ko bulwake wahaa'n mera bhi dil shaad karo<br />
lo kanizi me sakina ki mujhe yaad karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>gar nahi mujh ko bulate ho to aao baba<br />
shouq se apni sakina ko bhi laao baba<br />
usko sine pa sulaate ho sulaao baba<br />
ham ko rulwate ho to qair rulaao baba</p>

<p>ranj sahti huwi dunya se guzar jaaungi<br />
aap aaye nahi ek roz mai marjaaungi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aarzu hai ke kisi tour yahan aajaye'n<br />
aap ki jaan se door, aah jo ham marjaaye'n<br />
apne hathou se kafan aap mujhe pahnaaye'n<br />
aur takleef lahad tak bhi zara farmaaye'n</p>

<p>bas zyada na sawari yaha'n tehraiyega<br />
dafn karte hi mujhe aap chale jaaiyega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maa ko marqoom tha aye madar-e- farqanda siyar<br />
saqt baba ki tarha karliya tumne bhi jigar<br />
aas bachne ki nahi lijiye ab jald qabar<br />
warna bimaar ka ab hota hai dunya se safar</p>

<p>nahi ummed ke bach jaaye ye muztar amma<br />
doodh ab baqsh do bimaar ko aakar amma<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha raqam hazrat-e- zainab ko phupi nek qisaal<br />
tum ko bhaiyya ali akbar se mohabbat hai kamaal<br />
haaye har dam mujhe reh reh ke ab aata hai qayaal<br />
ke mera bhai pa bhari hai ye attharwa'n saal</p>

<p>haan tasadduq ke liye der na farmaaiyega<br />
sadqe hone ke liye bhai pa bulwaaiyega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha alamdar ko tahreer ke abbas chacha<br />
door uftada bhatiji se huwe tum bhi qafa<br />
sunte hai aapki har baat ko mere baba<br />
mujh ko bulwaaiye, ya laaiye unko mai fidaa</p>

<p>chumungi unke qadam tumko duaa'en doongi<br />
unki bhi aur tumhari bhi balaye'n loongi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likha akbar ko ke aye baap ke pyare akbar<br />
aur phupi jaan ke bhi raaj dulaare akbar<br />
mere baba ki zaeefi ke sahare akbar<br />
hai ye bimaar bahan gor kanaare akbar</p>

<p>waada lejaane ka tha dekhiye kab aate hai'n<br />
aap to aate nahi qalq se ham jaate hai'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha qitaab asghar-e- nadaa'n se ke aye rashk-e- qamar<br />
ghutniyo'n bhi na chale ho gaya darpesh safar<br />
mujh ko har dam tera rehta hai qayaal aath (8) pahar<br />
sote ho jhule me ya jaagte ho aye asghar</p>

<p>neend aaram se aur chain se aati hogi<br />
jab sakina tere jhoole ko jhulati hogi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yaad aate hai tumhare wo jhundule mujhe baal<br />
sadosi saal salaamat raho aye mere laal<br />
tumko bimaar bahan ka nahi maloom ahwaaal<br />
mout nazdeek hai aur zouf-o- naqahat hai kamaal</p>

<p>mai jo marjaau'n kahi'n bhool na jana asghar<br />
ghutniyo'n chalte huwe qabr pa aana asghar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye na tha ilm use kat gaya sarwar ka gala<br />
qasim-o- akbar-o- abbas huwe shah pa fida<br />
teer kha kar ali asghar bhi gaye sooe baqaa<br />
baaqi ek bhai tha sajjad so wo qaid huwa</p>

<p>maa, phupi, bahne'n luti qaime bhi taraaj huwe<br />
ek chaadar ko haram shaah ke mohtaaj huwe<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>